0.04/22.04, macOS M2, WSL2, Alpine: reuse the same loosened pyproject.toml and run `poetry update` in each environment to regenerate a local lock compatible with that OS.\\n- tree-sitter, zope-interface, and e2b were the blockers here. If other environments reveal more conflicts, follow the same approach to relax or add markers as needed.\\n- Results are under /workspace/benchmark/results/ for review and archival.\\n\\nIf you want me to push the local commit to the GitLab repo or to prepare CI for the cross-OS checks, let me know.', task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought='', action='finish')], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.FINISHED: 'finished'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.22430825000000001, 'costs': [{'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.001409, 'timestamp': 1763579983.9082952}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.001264, 'timestamp': 1763579987.559245}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.0019977500000000004, 'timestamp': 1763579989.0298424}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.0020782500000000002, 'timestamp': 1763579994.1095831}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.003922750000000001, 'timestamp': 1763580003.4636178}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.006937250000000001, 'timestamp': 1763580016.6910634}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.00766175, 'timestamp': 1763580027.2556603}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.0052787500000000005, 'timestamp': 1763580036.8258684}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.0247605, 'timestamp': 1763580069.5906053}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.0023150000000000002, 'timestamp': 1763580102.1109297}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.0030637499999999996, 'timestamp': 1763580136.6722019}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.0057262500000000004, 'timestamp': 1763580177.7644284}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.00952475, 'timestamp': 1763580228.284425}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.00210325, 'timestamp'